(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".exe -i C:\\") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "-o Windows\\"))) OR ((where(Hashes ICONTAINS "IMPHASH=E1742EE971D6549E8D4D81115F88F1FC") OR where(Hashes ICONTAINS "IMPHASH=DD82066EFBA94D7556EF582F247C8BB5"))) OR (where(Image IENDSWITH "\\LocalPotato.exe")))
